Package: directCareBilling
Title: Shared Stripe Subscription Billing for directCare Apps
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Anthony W.", "Raborn", , "anthony@raborndecisionsciences.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared Stripe integration layer for the one subscription per
    practice that gates paid features across both directCareAnalytics and
    directCarePlanner -- Checkout/Billing Portal session creation, webhook
    signature verification, and webhook event dispatch into the shared
    Postgres `practices` table. Database functions take an already-open
    DBI connection (see directCareAuth::db_connect()). See
    STRIPE_BILLING.md at the repo root for the full design.
License: Apache License (>= 2) | file LICENSE
